 ## Operating characteristics
-*   **Time Complexity:** $O(1)$ per edge [S1, unofficial]. The computation involves a fixed number of arithmetic operations and boundary checks.
-*   **Memory Complexity:** $O(1)$ auxiliary space. Requires storage for 4 indices and a few temporary variables.
-*   **Strengths:** Fast, deterministic, and efficient for edge-based surface extraction.
-*   **Limitations:** Requires careful boundary handling. The specific stride formulas depend on the uniform grid dimension parameter $m\_size$ [S1, unofficial].
-*   **When to use:** When implementing Marching Cubes or similar algorithms that require access to all cells sharing an edge.
-*   **When not to use:** When only a single cell lookup is needed (use [Uniform Grid Indexing](6941-uniform-grid-indexing.md)).
